{"server":"tw","storyId":"act8mini_level_act8mini_st04","groupId":"act8mini","stageId":null,"title":"我所思不止於此","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act8mini/level_act8mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"793479e016093533d94df23049e9664f0abec7c157c767c11978c16a656323ec","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"巴別塔內出現了謀反者，襲擊對象竟然是博士。Scout及時趕到並擒住了謀反者，而如何處置他，特蕾西婭和博士有不同的態度。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"“Dr.{@nickname}”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，你們在很久、很久以前就認識了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不必擔心，我只是有點緊張。畢竟，你認識博士比認識我還早，我想在博士面前留下個好印象嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"只是啊，凱爾希，對於現在的“博士”是什麼樣的人，你也有些疑惑吧？你都寫在臉上啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我也認識一下吧，凱爾希。我很好奇，那個與你的過去息息相關的“博士”，究竟是什麼樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"以及如何去看待，如何相處，如何將我、將薩卡茲與之相連......這都是必須由我自己判斷的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我的看法，也能對你有所影響吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，凱爾希啊，請帶我去見見博士吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout，辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一次偵查任務，我應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......凱爾希和博士在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......會議室，有什麼情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在軍事委員會的間諜已經傳回了情報。他們並不打算給我們任何喘息的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"間諜......是指那位血魔親王嗎？殿下，我認為她所信仰的只有大君，並不可信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"他們大都是牟取自身利益的投機者，若非形勢所迫，她甚至不會參與戰爭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我明白你的疑慮，Scout。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不過至少現在，她是不會對我撒謊的。她還沒有那個勇氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希？博士？你們在忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......殿下。會議已經結束了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，並不是什麼愉快的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我打擾你們的工作了嗎？對了，難得在午餐之前就開完了會議，凱爾希，想不想和我一起吃午飯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......時間還很早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......似乎確實早了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是和平時相比，你來得太早了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很難想像議長室裡坐著的那些人會這麼輕鬆就放你出來，除非，那個結果糟糕到不需要討論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是這樣，你來得還是......太早了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......但我們對現狀......早有預料，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，交談並不順暢。並且我猜情況更糟，幾乎到了一觸即發的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會獲得了更大的支援，我們在卡茲戴爾的資訊管道在不斷減少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔很可能會在這個秋天遭到一次圍剿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"一些薩卡茲背叛了我們，這是意料之內的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......但巴別塔還沒有徹底做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，凱爾希。看起來，我們沒有機會堅持到那一天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那食腐者之王和其餘王庭成員的態度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過是提出更加苛刻的要求，放心吧，凱爾希，他們只是針對我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......我們已經沒有更多的餘裕去對付更多的質疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，博士？啊......對了，我還沒正式徵求過意見，這樣貿然發出指令太失禮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，看來我們必須離卡茲戴爾更遠一些。這會是一次全面的轉移，或者說，撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼別的意見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"也許這是唯一的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能的話，我也想給予所有人更多的選擇。但現在沒有時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會的想法過分激進和直接，我堅持反對他們的理念。但為了阻止卡茲戴爾發生無謂的犧牲，我們唯有暫時離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信——至今相信，我們仍共用同一心臟，同一血脈。但是相融的血脈也會暫時分開，不知道什麼時候才會再次合流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"至少現在，分開是損傷最少的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"每個薩卡茲人都有跟隨自己信念的渴望。我能感受到你的理想，也會有眾多薩卡茲人追隨你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不會幫你做出選擇，我只會見證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這是目前最好的安排了，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，事不宜遲，二位也趕快收拾行李準備出發吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"能帶走多少東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，並不多。許多設施都可能要遺棄，阿斯卡綸會為我們拖延時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"已經足夠了，特蕾西婭，不用派更多的人手來幫助我們，我會帶著博士和你安全會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼就和之前預演的方案一樣，凱爾希，負責人稍後就到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，博士，凱爾希，很抱歉讓你們這樣匆忙撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這些研究也只能暫時擱置了......我也多麼希望能看到這些研究得出豐碩的成果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我會努力創造出能夠繼續進行研究的空間。還有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信事情會有所轉機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"narration","text":"十三天後\n卡茲戴爾邊境，巴別塔駐紮營地，“Dr.{@nickname}營所”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別的蠢貨或許還在糾結，但在你單獨行動的時候下手，是唯一的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，你不該這麼做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......這是你在現在的處境下能說出口的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我早就受不了了。殿下......殿下她竟然讓你站在高台上，讓你參觀對我們的演講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你什麼都沒為我們做過！你根本理解不了我們的事業！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，和那個菲林，你們連薩卡茲都不是，也不屬於卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們現在圍繞在殿下身旁，以最親密的距離構成她即將成立的那個幻想中的“巴別塔”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多麼可笑......堂堂特蕾西婭殿下，那位存續百年的大英雄，竟然需要幾個外族人指手畫腳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信你們......！別有所圖的外族人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，“博士”，既然殿下對異鄉來的你如此信任，而你以旁觀者身份自處。那麼就由你說說，哪邊勝率更大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你僅僅只能為保全自己而思考——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是十分可憐的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這混——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"說夠了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......Scout......你怎麼會在這裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看阿斯卡綸，叛徒，更不要小看殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下的選擇是一次仁慈的布教，允許子民擁有哪怕一次自由的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......可你卻用來做這種齷齪的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明知道殿下尊重博士，也聽到了博士的公開言論，這是和我們的“內戰”無關的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，利用了殿下的善良......還有博士的寬容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我可以不必審判你，叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。我只是要做該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，Scout。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他想從我這裡得到一些回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他如果只是想殺我，而不是迷茫在某些選擇之中，他大可以直接動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，好吧，聽您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我和他聊聊吧，Scout。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭不會生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......想把刀架在我脖子上，還和我講道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑......咳......可惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，為什麼你的殿下會去相信兩個外族人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈......殿下為何信任你？無非是你用花言巧語，口舌技巧來搬弄是非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑，實在是可笑......我們的殿下，滿口理想的殿下，不過是聽信了又一個弄臣的論調！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"可薩卡茲......你嘲弄我，沒有辦法陪特蕾西婭走下去。這是註定的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你不信任的並非我，而是你的殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你憑什麼——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的你，太容易受人指使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你無法成為一個忠臣，你更無法相信一個願景。只是理性告訴你，“殿下”這個詞讓你的選擇更加正統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"荒謬！你想汙衊我！？你敢說我不相信殿下的道路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是你親口說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"骯髒的外族人，你血口噴人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你想聽我的看法？我會告訴你，薩卡茲人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你絕非因為我與凱爾希而對殿下失去信任。你恐懼自己不再信任特蕾西婭這件事，並單方面嫁禍給他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"放屁！我要是真的離開了殿下，那也要帶著你的人頭交差！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你只是對特蕾西婭的宣講感到失望並歸咎於我，為什麼要找我對質？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅是恐懼殿下的實力？僅僅是因為自己無法改變殿下的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在迷茫，你不知道自己的命運。“他”卻想得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"“你”是誰也根本無足輕重。他知道，總會有你這樣的人，總會有這樣一道橋樑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在說誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他們點醒你，煽動你，不是為了讓我聽這些虛張聲勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他只不過是想知道，特蕾西婭說了什麼，而我作何反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我本不在委員會的預料之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他必須確認這一點。特蕾西婭是否得到了別的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想說什麼？詭計，謊言，引誘我說出坐實叛逃罪名的供狀，就為了在Scout面前演好這場戲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"不，薩卡茲人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"——我是要你活著走出這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你在開玩笑？這是哪族的笑話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"“誰能帶領人們活下去，誰是他們心中的王。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識你，“叛徒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"那個晚上，是你扛著負傷的阿斯卡綸回到營地，是你帶著最後一位陣亡將士的口信，將斥候隊伍的方位通知全軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我給你這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能......我憑什麼相信你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......看看現狀吧，叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"不論博士說了什麼，你現在只能相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不！Scout！別被這個人蒙蔽了，他放走我也只是為了更好地汙衊，我哪裡都不會去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你想汙衊我是特雷西斯的間諜！？你根本不知道我經歷過什麼——我可是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......您受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，事出突然，是我沒能察覺到隊伍中的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我讓Scout停手的，否則，這位薩卡茲可能已經身首異處了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......我瞭解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"殿、殿下......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，宣講的時候，你站在下面。你是眾多同族中的面孔之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士說的對，你和你的雇傭兵為我們立下過戰功，可這並不是......你眼下行為的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......殿、殿下......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你......不信任我嗎？馬爾科？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"救下了那麼多同胞的你，從最危險的地方為我們帶回情報的你，現在，不再願意相信我了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不不！我......我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"（我甚至不敢抬頭看她......我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"（我都說了什麼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"您直接審問他，看來是不會有任何進展的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"撤離在即，形勢嚴峻。我們必須立刻確認隊伍中是否還有對您心懷不滿的——或是，卡茲戴爾方面的間諜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"請把他交給阿斯卡綸處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......在此之前，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"能告訴我，他剛才對你做了什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他什麼都沒做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"這也許是一場行刺，卻不儘然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭，如果我說，到目前為止，他算是最無辜的那一個。你會相信嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶吼聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......Dr.{@nickname}。這裡不需要風趣的笑話，Scout也不會認為自己摻和進了一場滑稽的玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可至少，這個薩卡茲確實並不在先前俘虜供認的間諜名單之中，特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"一個外族人！竟敢直呼殿下其名......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......你痛恨凱爾希嗎？痛恨博士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"只因為，他們不是薩卡茲？而非因為他們所做的事情，將要做的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，是這樣，殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"您的身邊有那麼多優秀的人，為何偏偏要讓這兩個外族人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我明白你的意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"容許我再多詢問一句，Scout，你的判斷是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重博士和您的判斷，但要依我看，現在應立刻將他收押，關進牢房。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"若依軍法，死路一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這只是一種選擇。我們總是面臨著無數種選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不論他背負什麼樣的詭計和心思，終究無法抵抗這樣的渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這種行為不會是最後一次的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭，萬一這次放任產生了多餘的麻煩，之後也會威脅到你的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是做出了一個遺憾的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不，殿下......！請......請聽我說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......薩卡茲......卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲......！我只是不願看著您......和巴別塔就這麼遠離卡茲戴爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"起初，這是我最抗拒的事。詭計啊，謀略啊......如果不是為了最終和平的必經之路，我怎樣都很難接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"可是薩卡茲們等待了太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"無窮無盡的戰爭裡，還要用這樣一場戰事，同數萬生命一起，去開闢這片大地，去瞭解它的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，博士，對待你們，這將是我的態度。我們信念一致，也可以互相補足。因此，我選擇尊重博士的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請告訴我你的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"這個薩卡茲......他做出了背叛的行為，不是對於我，而是對於他心中那已令他失望的特蕾西婭的形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他並不能稱作叛徒。以我所見，特蕾西婭殿下既然願意給那麼多人自由——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"——何不流放這個曾立下戰功的薩卡茲，看他如何選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓他在大地上自生自滅吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，他將拾起一個新的信念，無論是您的，還是別人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"——你......你為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我反對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使現有證據無法證明他和軍事委員會有所牽連，我也不認為放走一個公然襲擊指揮官的士兵，能有什麼益處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"殿、殿下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......軍功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，馬爾科，你是一個......薩卡茲傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，Scout。帶他去見阿斯卡綸吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔會定你的罪，阿斯卡綸會定你的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你還自認是一位卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲，你就不能離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"——殿下！您要，處死我——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout，在他有什麼過激情緒之前，把他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"——不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不！不！您——您做得對——沒錯，殺死我！您就該如此，讓優柔寡斷見鬼去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"——您曾是戰爭的英雄！處死一個叛徒，處死我這樣一個庸人，是您真正該做的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"老實點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我錯了......我錯了，殿下，您還保留著我們憧憬的那一面，我們聆聽了數十年的故事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"六位英雄的旗幟還在飄揚，多少人聽著您統領薩卡茲對抗外族入侵的故事長大！多少人等待著那個時代重新來臨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我在等——我們一直在等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還在等著那些傳說重現，等著那些塗滿鮮血的歷史熊熊燃燒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲就該如此——薩卡茲必須如此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下！這才是正確的，您才是正確的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......目前的情況就是這樣。能夠聯繫到的雇傭兵團會在兩日後趕到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"誰的隊伍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，他是個優秀的指揮官，只是，他似乎比表面上還要厭惡戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我會確保他能及時抵達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許有一天，薩卡茲真的能遠離紛爭與無意義的犧牲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情很悲傷，因為馬爾科的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是從他的身上，看到了一個縮影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"道路還很遙遠，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"太遠了，特蕾西婭，所以你的人民想要的，是近在眼前的某個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但你會陪我走下去的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，聽說您昨晚還在做一些......時裝設計？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，凱爾希要教訓我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，怎麼會呢，適當的放鬆可以宣洩你的壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"局勢並不樂觀，你的一舉一動都將會影響到全體薩卡茲的士氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，博士，怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸剛才通知了我們，馬爾科畏罪自殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......為了不讓他的君王為難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......你接下來要去做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"除了雇傭兵，那些隱藏在卡茲戴爾勢力範圍內各地的薩卡茲，都在關注我們的動向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一場全面的遷移，情報工作與後勤工作，亦不容懈怠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......辛苦了，稍後我會去找阿斯卡綸談談的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"她會物色好人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"請放心，我信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"多希望，我所窺見到的那些願景，能在此......不，至少在我們所能夠目及的時光裡，前進一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經習以為常。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]}]}
